    "Homebrew is currently ignoring formulae, casks and commands from these taps because tap trust is required." : {
      "comment" : "Doctor explanation: untrusted taps are not used",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由于需要信任这些 tap，Homebrew 目前会忽略其中的配方、Cask 和命令。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "由於需要信任這些 tap，Homebrew 目前會忽略其中的配方、Cask 和命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you didn't put them there on purpose they could cause problems when building Homebrew formulae and may need to be deleted." : {
      "comment" : "Doctor explanation: unexpected files may interfere with formula builds",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果这些文件并非你有意放置，它们可能干扰 Homebrew 配方的构建，可能需要删除。"
