    },
    "Please note that these warnings are just used to help the Homebrew maintainers with debugging if you file an issue. If everything you use Homebrew for is working fine: please don't worry or file an issue; just ignore this. Thanks!" : {
      "comment" : "Doctor reassurance: findings help Homebrew maintainers but need not be reported if everything works",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请注意：这些警告只是为了在你提交问题时帮助 Homebrew 维护者排查故障。如果你使用的 Homebrew 功能一切正常，无需担心或提交问题，忽略即可。谢谢！"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請注意：這些警告只是為了在你提交問題時協助 Homebrew 維護者排查故障。如果你使用的 Homebrew 功能一切正常，無須擔心或提交問題，忽略即可。謝謝！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
